# A pack with photos: each species page shows its photo and who took it.
wait-for 2 packs, 10 species.
companion fieldbook push scripts/fixtures/fieldbook/photo-pack --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for 3 packs, 12 species.
tap Packs
wait-for Garden Birds
expect GB-ENG · issued 2026-10-01 · 2 species
expect legacy-pack.csv: unknown format
# A pack tapped from the list opens the search and becomes the outing's tally.
tap Garden Birds
wait-for Find
type sparrow
tap Find
wait-for House Sparrow
tap House Sparrow
wait-for Passer domesticus
wait-idle
expect Photo: Fixture Maker · CC0
clean
shot photos-species
tap Back
wait-for House Sparrow
expect Search packs
tap Today
wait-for Start an outing
tap Start an outing
wait-for Name this place
type hedge
tap Save
wait-for hedge
expect House Sparrow
expect European Robin
expect-missing American Robin
clean
shot photos-tally
tap House Sparrow
wait-for 1 logged
